    Bug 2006549 - Restrict localised folder names to those with specific names. r=aleca,edicharry
    This takes us back to an earlier version¹ but with the addition of a few more names.
    There's also now a preference, mail.useLocalizedFolderNames, which can be used to disable localised
    folder names on remote folders. Changing this preference requires a restart.

    ¹ https://hg-edge.mozilla.org/comm-central/diff/0c02f4237c83098e84a3424f95bd8d6a55517226/mailnews/base/src/nsMsgDBFolder.cpp#l1.190

    Differential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D276805

